lu marry in 1969?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Maurice Gibb was one of the Bee Gees; he and Lulu divorced in 1973.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-73b1-9769-d68d212ac561","description":"Maurice Gibb","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7353-a3f2-89fc898ec4ed","description":"Tom Jones","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7ff1-a6b0-33cf3076bf4d","description":"Paul McCartney","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7afd-9216-0b24325eb04c","description":"Brian Wilson","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7963-81de-9c7b295eb686","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"What is the currency of Iceland?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Iceland uses the kr\u00f3na and is not a member of the eurozone.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7563-84ed-0bd3e9de8b7d","description":"Kr\u00f3na","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7dd4-bd47-5ea89a275fc8","description":"Euro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7320-abd5-03ef9d6ac87a","description":"Franc","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-75e6-958c-7bd0668814f1","description":"Mark","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7cac-9b7e-6df36590be6d","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44480fe2c4f5","question":"Which university\'s physical plan was designed by Frederick Law Olmsted for an ex-governor of California?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Leland and Jane Stanford founded Stanford University in memory of their son, Leland Jr. Frederick Law Olmsted prepared a plan for its campus.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7778-a128-8911539e2e19","description":"Stanford","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-71e5-9857-40680086602e","description":"Harvard","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-734f-9425-d020d06a87de","description":"Yale","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-777c-8450-2804daafa69b","description":"MIT","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae3f-7d23-95c6-b108e14dd292","category":"01a21312-b489-7095-8a30-44